{info:title=Advanced Kubernetes Vault Patterns}
Advanced integration patterns for Vault and Kubernetes including GitOps workflows, multi-namespace patterns, and performance optimization.
{info}

{panel:title=Page Information|borderStyle=dashed|borderColor=#ccc|titleBGColor=#d9ead3|bgColor=#f9f9f9}
*Target Audience:* Senior Kubernetes Engineers, Platform Architects, SRE Teams
*Prerequisites:* Basic Kubernetes-Vault integration, GitOps knowledge
